<title>USA: Tellabs to supply Martis to P Plus.</title>
<headline>Tellabs to supply Martis to P Plus.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Wednesday it will supply its Martis DXX network equipment for P Plus Communications Ltd's wireless communications service in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>P Plus Communications was one of six winners of Personal Communications Services licenses in Hong Kong. It will launch a digital wireless network in the middle of 1997, Tellabs said.</p>
<p>P Plus Communications is a consortium consisting of Star Paging (International Holdings) Ltd, Telecom Finland, PEWC Telecommunications Co, and Telecom Services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
